# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Canonical monorepo runtime and external worktrees
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The research-domain layout keeps large mutable payloads below projects/.
# Track their manifests/reports, never the datasets, checkpoints, caches, or
# embedded repositories themselves.
/.cometml-runs/
/projects/shared/storage/
/projects/shared/runtime/
/projects/weight-vae/runtime/
/projects/unclassified/runtime/
/projects/lsdl/source/data/
/projects/weight-vae/workspace/.cometml-runs/
/projects/weight-vae/workspace/.pytest_cache/
/projects/weight-vae/workspace/.ruff_cache/
/projects/weight-vae/workspace/train_big_vae.log
/projects/weight-vae/workspace/post_train_research/**/artifacts/
/projects/weight-vae/workspace/post_train_research/loss_landscape_analysis/data/

# Independent embedded repositories are versioned and pushed from their own
# Git roots, not as accidental gitlinks in this repository.
/projects/cfm/source/
/projects/cfm/baselines/bd3lms-upstream/
